<title>UK: Bank Austria sets 150 mln rand two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets 150 mln rand two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.0 PCT  MATURITY    02.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    02.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
